license: MIT

abstract: >-
  A Windows-friendly Python desktop application for visualization and
  exploratory analysis of MALDI mass spectrometry imaging data in imzML
  format. The software provides whole-image mean and pixel spectra,
  selected-ion and total-ion images, rectangular region-of-interest analysis,
  custom multi-ion overlays, optional additional TIC normalization, and
  publication-quality figure export.

keywords:
  - MALDI imaging
  - imzML
  - mass spectrometry imaging
  - ion imaging
  - Python
